19	     *  included (an OPEN or PENDING one alike), else live: its amount times its person's rate in force on
20	     *  its date for their grade then, divided by 100, rounded to two decimals as the claim rounds (see Rounding); null
21	     *  (n/a) when no rate applies. The floor is not in it: it is applied before the late charge (see shown). */
22	    public static BigDecimal figure(Claim claim, Grades grades, Rates rates, Rounding rounding) {
23	        if (claim.settledDue() != null) {
24	            return claim.settledDue();
25	        }
26	        if (claim.stated()) {
27	            return claim.statedDue();
28	        }
29	        return live(claim, grades, rates, rounding);
30	    }
