82	    /** Whether a claim counts toward a period's due-totals: its status at the end of the period's last day (see
83	     *  ClaimLogRepository.statusesAt; null: it was added after) is OPEN, PENDING or SETTLED, and it is left out
84	     *  as the live rules leave it out: deferred on the sheet's today, or an OPEN or PENDING one of a retired person
