327	 *  (a negative amount) the number of the SETTLED claim of the same person it corrects (null otherwise), and its
328	 *  due-by: the terms-th business day after the date it had when it was created, with the terms fixed then (its person's
329	 *  own, else their grade's in force on that date, else the sheet's), skipping Saturdays, Sundays and the sheet's
330	 *  holidays as they are now; it does not change when the terms or its date change later; and the date it is deferred until (null: never
331	 *  deferred): an OPEN claim deferred past the sheet's today is deferred (see deferredOn); and its proofs count (0 or more,
332	 *  raised one at a time); and the number of the claim it was split from (null when it was not split off one); and whether it is a
333	 *  late entry: added while its period was soft-closed (fixed when it was added); and the last sheet-today a reminder was
334	 *  written for it (null: never reminded); and its external reference (null: none), unique on the sheet without regard to case;
335	 *  and its tags (null: none): trimmed, lower-cased, without repeats, sorted and joined by commas; and whether a steward waived its late charge
336	 *  (it then bears none, overdue or not); and how many of its proofs are photos (the rest are receipts); and whether it is held
337	 *  (only an OPEN or PENDING claim is held or released): held, an OPEN one not bound by a statement counts in no live
338	 *  total, as one dated within its person's hold does (see Dues.counts). */
339	public record Claim(long id, String sheetId, long personId, BigDecimal amount, LocalDate date, String note,
